    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac SP$, $P\\ne0$, where $S=a+b$ and $P=ab$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac1a+\\frac1b&=\\frac{a+b}{ab}\\\\\\frac1a+\\frac1b&=\\frac SP\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: real $a,b$ with $a\\ne0$ and $b\\ne0$; $S=a+b$ and $P=ab\\ne0$.",
